```

## Message Flow

### Telemetry → Feature Store

```
TelemetryAgent (CSV/Synthetic/Real)
    │  VolumeMetric JSON
    ▼
Kafka: io.telemetry.raw
    │
    ├── FeatureEngineeringConsumer (streaming)
    │       │  compute derived + rolling features
    │       ├── Redis: features:{volume_id}   (TTL 5min)
    │       └── Kafka: io.telemetry.features
    │
    └── BatchBackfill (scheduled)
            │
            └── Parquet: data/offline_store/features/date=YYYY-MM-DD/
```

### Inference → Decision → Action

```
InferenceHub (FastAPI :8080)
    │  reads from Redis: features:{volume_id}
    ├── POST /classify         → workload classification
    ├── POST /detect-hotspot   → hotspot event
    └── POST /forecast         → capacity/latency forecast

DecisionEngine
    │  consumes classification, hotspot, forecast
    ├── on_hotspot_event()     → REBALANCE_VOLUME or APPLY_QOS
    ├── on_forecast_result()   → TIER_MIGRATE or REBALANCE
    └── on_classification()    → TIER_MIGRATE (tier affinity)

Actions → Kafka: io.rebalance.actions
    │
    ├── ExecutionMonitor (pre-check, rate-limit, rollback)
    └── Actuator (CSI / ArrayAPI / Stub)
```

## Kafka Topics

| Topic                   | Producer          | Consumer(s)                     | Retention |
|-------------------------|-------------------|---------------------------------|-----------|
| `io.telemetry.raw`      | TelemetryAgent    | FeatureEngineeringConsumer      | 7 days    |
| `io.telemetry.features` | FeatureConsumer   | InferenceHub, DecisionEngine    | 3 days    |
| `io.hotspot.events`     | InferenceHub      | DecisionEngine                  | 30 days   |
| `io.rebalance.actions`  | DecisionEngine    | ExecutionMonitor, Actuators     | 90 days   |
| `io.audit.log`          | AuditLogger       | SIEM, compliance systems        | 1 year    |

## Feature Definitions

| Feature                  | Formula                              | Signal                        |
|--------------------------|--------------------------------------|-------------------------------|
| `iops_per_queue_depth`   | iops / queue_depth                  | IO efficiency                 |
| `throughput_per_iops`    | throughput_mbps × 1024 / iops       | Effective block size proxy    |
| `latency_iops_product`   | (latency_us/1000) × (iops/1000)     | Congestion signal             |
| `read_write_asymmetry`   | abs(read_ratio − 0.5)               | Access pattern skew           |
| `util_per_iops`          | disk_util_pct / (iops/1000)         | Storage pressure per kIOPS    |
| `throughput_per_util`    | throughput_mbps / disk_util_pct     | Throughput efficiency         |

## Workload Classification Profiles

| Class        | IOPS       | Throughput      | Latency     | Block Size   | Read Ratio |
|--------------|------------|-----------------|-------------|--------------|------------|
| `DB_OLTP`    | 30k–60k    | 100–250 MB/s    | <600µs      | 4–8 KB       | 60–90%     |
| `VM`         | 5k–20k     | 50–200 MB/s     | 0.8–2ms     | 8–64 KB      | 40–70%     |
| `Backup`     | <2k        | 700–1200 MB/s   | 5–12ms      | 256–512 KB   | <20%       |
| `AI_Training`| 3k–8k      | 1500–3000 MB/s  | 2–5ms       | 256KB–1MB    | >85%       |
| `AI_Inference`| 10k–40k  | 250–600 MB/s    | <1ms        | 4–16 KB      | 75–95%     |

## SLO Targets

| SLO                          | Target            | Alert Threshold   |
|------------------------------|-------------------|-------------------|
| Classification precision/recall | ≥ 95%          | < 90%             |
| Hotspot detection latency    | < 5 seconds       | > 10 seconds      |
| p95/p99 latency spike reduction | 20–40%         | < 10% improvement |
| Node utilization variance reduction | 20–40%    | < 10% improvement |
| Rollback rate                | < 1%              | > 0.5%            |
| SLO breaches during auto-actions | 0             | Any breach        |

## Model Lifecycle

```
train.py ──► MLflow Run ──► model_registry.register()
                                    │
                                    ▼
                             Stage: None (freshly registered)
                                    │
                          model_registry.promote_to_staging()
                                    │
                             Stage: Staging
                                    │
                  canary validation (metrics gate ≥ 95% F1)
                                    │
                         model_registry.promote_to_production()
                                    │
                             Stage: Production ◄── InferenceHub loads from here
                                    │
                          (next version promoted)
                                    │
                             Stage: Archived
```

## Drift → Retraining Loop

```
InferenceHub
    │  records every prediction
    ▼
DriftMonitorDaemon (every 60s)
    │  computes KL-divergence(production dist || training dist)
    │  computes PSI per feature
    ▼
KL > 0.10 OR PSI > 0.20 for any key feature?
    │  Yes → RetrainingTrigger.trigger()
    │         writes models/retrain_requested.json
    │         (prod: submits Airflow / Argo job)
    ▼
train.py → evaluate.py → promote_to_production()
```
